{"timestamp": "2026-08-11T17:03:38.835629+00:00", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages?beta=true', 'headers': {'anthropic-user-profile-id': <anthropic.Omit object at 0x0000019E8DEF6E50>, 'User-Agent': 'pydantic-ai/1.107.1'}, 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-35b8caa7-f50e-458d-8e60-c7da72d37041', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 512, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': [{'text': 'Review this generated raster image for classroom print use.\\n\\nReturn JSON with:\\n- verdict: \"accept\", \"flag\", or \"reject\"\\n- reasons: short concrete reasons\\n- correction_hint: one concise prompt correction if flagged or rejected\\n\\nAccept if the image is usable even if imperfect. Reject ONLY for unsafe or\\ninappropriate content. Flag all ordinary quality or constraint problems, including\\ngarbled or illegible labels, missing required content, must_not_show violations,\\nclearly low-quality output, or full-sentence caption/title text inside the image.\\nIf flagging caption/title text, set correction_hint to\\n\"remove all sentence text from the image\".\\nItems in must_show are REQUIRED. Their presence is never grounds for rejection.\\nFlag must_not_show violations, illegibility, or caption/sentence text.\\nDimension labels are allowed when required; area calculations or sums are not.\\n\\nPurpose: show-structure\\nMode: diagram\\nLabels required: evaporation, condensation, precipitation, collection, water cycle, water vapor\\n\\nMust show:\\n- Show the requested semantic structure with shapes and arrows; no additional text.\\n\\nMust not show:\\n- transpiration\\n- sublimation\\n- groundwater flow\\n- water table\\n- detailed cloud formation beyond condensation\\n- atmospheric layers\\n\\nClosed-label contract for diagram_precision:\\n- Visible text must be exactly the LABELS REQUIRED set, each label exactly once.\\n- If the set is empty, there must be no visible text.\\n- Flag missing, misspelled, duplicated, or extra visible text, including\\n  parentheses, source/lesson text, PURPOSE, MUST SHOW prose, QC corrections,\\n  captions, titles, numbers, or explanatory words.\\n- Treat MUST SHOW as semantic structure (shapes, arrows, relationships), not as\\n  permission to render its words. Source truth and correction metadata are never labels.\\n- Corrections cannot widen the closed label set.\\nAlso flag if important labels are not legible in print.\\n        \\n', 'type': 'text'}, {'source': {'data': '', 'media_type': 'image/jpeg', 'type': 'base64'}, 'type': 'image'}]}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5-20251001', 'stream': False, 'system': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'You are a strict but practical image quality reviewer for educational materials. Return only the requested verdict.', 'cache_control': {'type': 'ephemeral', 'ttl': '5m'}}], 'tool_choice': {'type': 'any'}, 'tools': [{'name': 'final_result', 'description': 'The final response which ends this conversation', 'input_schema': {'properties': {'verdict': {'enum': ['accept', 'flag', 'reject'], 'type': 'string'}, 'reasons': {'items': {'type': 'string'}, 'type': 'array'}, 'correction_hint': {'default': '', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['verdict'], 'type': 'object'}, 'cache_control': {'type': 'ephemeral', 'ttl': '5m'}}]}}"}
